sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(254,205,211) People
    actor Op as Operator
    actor Adm as Moodle admin
  end
  box rgb(254,215,170) Moodle
    participant Cron as Moodle cron and task runner
  end
  box rgb(253,240,138) Moodle plugin local_llmchat
    participant Set as Plugin settings and sync tasks
  end
  box rgb(187,247,208) Python server moodle_llm_chat
    participant CLI as Server CLI
    participant API as API ingest routes
    participant DB as Encrypted store
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over Op,DB: PHASE 1 - Operator registers the Moodle site on the Python server
    Op->>CLI: gen-master-key once, then site add with the Moodle URL
    CLI->>DB: add_site and generate a random site secret
    DB-->>CLI: site secret
    CLI-->>Op: prints the secret
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over Adm,DB: PHASE 2 - Admin connects the plugin to the API
    Adm->>Set: enters API URL and site secret
    Set->>Set: validates the URL
    Adm->>Set: presses Test connection
    Set->>API: GET ingest status with bearer site secret
    API->>DB: authenticate_site with the secret
    alt secret is valid
      DB-->>API: Site
      API-->>Set: content counts and pipeline status
      Set-->>Adm: connection OK
      Set->>Cron: queue push_policy_task
      Cron->>Set: run push_policy_task
      Set->>API: PUT quota policy
    else unknown or revoked secret
      API-->>Set: 401 unauthorized
      Set-->>Adm: connection failed
    end
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over Adm,API: PHASE 3 - First import
    Adm->>Set: presses Run full import now
    Set->>Cron: queue run_full_sync_task
    Cron->>Set: runs the full sync, see chart 2
    Set->>API: pushes the content
  end

  rect rgba(120,120,140,0.08)
    Note over Op,DB: PHASE 4 - Secret rotation without downtime
    Op->>CLI: site rotate
    CLI->>DB: rotate_site_secret with a grace period
    DB-->>CLI: new secret, the old one stays valid during the grace period
    CLI-->>Op: prints the new secret
    Adm->>Set: pastes the new secret
    Set->>API: requests with the new secret
    API->>DB: authenticate_site accepts every currently valid secret
    Note over API,DB: chat tokens also verify against every valid secret, so open chats keep working
    Note over DB: after the grace period only the new secret remains
    opt operator revokes the site
      Op->>CLI: site revoke
      CLI->>DB: revoke_site
      Note over API,DB: all requests and chat tokens for the site are rejected
    end
  end
